[SIZE=5][B]What is it?[/B][/SIZE]
A free Windows app for GTA World players. If you've lost a great scene because the chat reset when you reconnected, or spent ages lining chat up over a screenshot in Photoshop, this is for you.

[SIZE=5][B]What it does[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Saves your chat automatically.[/B] It runs in the background while you play and keeps every session as a text file, sorted by day.
[*][B]Lets you search your logs.[/B] Find text, filter by IC, /me, /do, /b or PMs, or show only certain characters.
[*][B]Makes chat screenshots that look like the game.[/B] Pick lines and click Extract image: you get a transparent PNG in the in-game chat style, using the same font (Arial or Mukta), chat scale, colors and shadow as your game.
[*][B]Lets you fix the text right on the image.[/B] Type, make words italic, recolor them, reorder or merge lines. Your saved log never changes.
[*][B]Builds the whole RP shot.[/B] Put game screenshots and chat images together on any canvas (550 × 550, 1080p…), move, resize, rotate, then export PNG or JPEG.
[/LIST]

