[SIZE=5][B]Is it safe?[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Everything stays on your PC. WorldKit doesn't connect to the internet.
[*]It doesn't touch the game: it reads a copy of FiveM's saved data and doesn't run inside FiveM.
[*]Your files live in [ICODE]%AppData%\WorldKit[/ICODE]. Delete the folder and they're gone.
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Get it[/B][/SIZE]
Download [B]WorldKit-Setup.exe[/B] from the [URL=https://github.com/vuenno/WorldKit/releases/latest]latest release[/URL], install it, and play as usual. Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit).

Bugs or ideas? Reply here. Screenshots of what you made with it are welcome too.

[SIZE=2][I]Fan-made tool, not affiliated with GTA World, Cfx.re/FiveM or Rockstar Games.[/I][/SIZE]
